  id: Home_NEW
  title: H O M E
  button: BEST FRIEND
  riddle: 'One of us walks on four feet, one on two;

    one of us broke it, and
    guess who?

    One wall for each, a crash in between,

    and one wag of a
    tail wipes the slate clean.'
  hint: 'Left wall: a dog sitting up, ears pricked, as a flower pot tumbles off the
    table beside it. Right wall: its owner, who saw it all.'
  complete: 'GOOD BOY

    It was only a flower pot.'
